  accTitle: Timeline of the 14 October outage
  accDescr: Alerts fired on checkout errors at 09:12 and on-call acknowledged at 09:15; the bad config push was identified at 09:31, the rollback started at 09:40, the error rate was back to normal at 09:52, and the all-clear was posted at 10:30.
